WEBVTT

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:23.050
Before I knew it, I abandoned happiness to survive

00:00:23.720 --> 00:00:30.190
Lying to myself, I danced clinging on to illusions

00:00:30.990 --> 00:00:36.870
At the edge of my vision when I close my eyes

00:00:37.270 --> 00:00:42.840
I was searching for your smile

00:00:43.740 --> 00:00:50.210
With our memories fading

00:00:50.750 --> 00:00:57.290
We hold on to our dreams and run  Yeah

00:00:57.620 --> 00:01:04.190
These feelings that I shut away in my heart

00:01:04.730 --> 00:01:11.410
I'll now grasp them again

00:01:32.180 --> 00:01:36.900
Though already hurt, Jonouchi fought Mai to the end.

00:01:36.900 --> 00:01:39.240
But he ran out of strength.

00:01:39.240 --> 00:01:45.020
He freed Mai from the darkness in her heart, but his soul was taken.

00:01:45.020 --> 00:01:47.720
The one who controls Mai and the Three Musketeers!

00:01:47.720 --> 00:01:51.560
The one who stole my partner and Jonouchi’s souls!

00:01:51.560 --> 00:01:53.620
The true enemy is Dartz!

00:01:53.620 --> 00:01:56.660
I won't forgive you!

00:01:56.660 --> 00:02:02.670
Duel of Destiny!
Yugi vs Rafael

00:02:04.020 --> 00:02:06.620
Jonouchi!

00:02:09.420 --> 00:02:11.070
Jonouchi...

00:02:18.420 --> 00:02:19.620
Jonouchi...

00:02:20.340 --> 00:02:21.620
You…

00:02:23.060 --> 00:02:24.910
It can’t be...

00:02:27.870 --> 00:02:30.390
He lost his soul too?

00:02:30.390 --> 00:02:32.160
But who took it?

00:02:32.530 --> 00:02:34.050
Mai!

00:02:34.050 --> 00:02:37.530
She was looking for Jonouchi and Valon.

00:02:37.530 --> 00:02:40.490
She definitely did this!

00:02:40.490 --> 00:02:41.760
Can't be...

00:02:41.760 --> 00:02:45.040
Damn!  I'll never forgive Mai!

00:02:45.040 --> 00:02:47.470
Mai?  No.

00:02:47.470 --> 00:02:52.370
We can't forgive the true enemy - the one who controls the Three Musketeers!

00:02:59.490 --> 00:03:00.840
Yugi?

00:03:44.750 --> 00:03:45.690
Mai!

00:03:48.200 --> 00:03:49.980
What happened to Mai?

00:03:56.210 --> 00:03:58.290
A Harpie's feather?

00:03:58.600 --> 00:03:59.640
No.

00:04:50.620 --> 00:04:53.770
I knew it was you, Rafael!

00:04:55.710 --> 00:04:58.800
Nameless Pharaoh, I was waiting for you.

00:05:03.970 --> 00:05:07.090
This is Jonouchi’s Claw of Hermos!

00:05:07.540 --> 00:05:10.290
You took Jonouchi and Mai's souls!

00:05:10.290 --> 00:05:13.460
Mai Kujaku defeated Jonouchi.

00:05:13.460 --> 00:05:16.400
Then why is Mai unconscious?

00:05:16.820 --> 00:05:20.540
She foolishly turned against Dartz.

00:05:21.210 --> 00:05:23.560
I have no business with you, Rafael!

00:05:23.560 --> 00:05:25.000
Where's Dartz?

00:05:25.730 --> 00:05:30.420
I no longer need Doma's power or The Seal of Orichalcos!

00:05:30.420 --> 00:05:33.750
I'll defeat Dartz with my own power!

00:05:33.750 --> 00:05:37.640
That’s how I can repay Jonouchi and Valon!

00:05:37.640 --> 00:05:40.200
Know your place, Mai Kujaku.

00:05:40.200 --> 00:05:42.680
You're nothing more than a sacrifice.

00:05:42.680 --> 00:05:43.760
What?

00:05:43.760 --> 00:05:45.640
Don’t be so brazen.

00:05:45.640 --> 00:05:47.360
Your role is over.

00:05:47.760 --> 00:05:49.830
Just vanish.

00:06:00.870 --> 00:06:01.670
Sorry…

00:06:02.520 --> 00:06:06.280
Sorry, Jonouchi...

00:06:15.590 --> 00:06:20.520
Jonouchi got through to Mai.  But...

00:06:20.880 --> 00:06:26.360
Jonouchi and Mai wanted you to have that card.

00:06:26.360 --> 00:06:28.200
So you should have it.

00:06:28.620 --> 00:06:30.100
Rafael!

00:06:30.610 --> 00:06:34.810
Doesn’t your heart hurt?

00:06:35.360 --> 00:06:41.150
Pegasus, Haga, Ryuzaki, Mai, Jonouchi.

00:06:41.150 --> 00:06:43.040
And my partner.

00:06:43.600 --> 00:06:46.270
How many souls did you steal?

00:06:48.410 --> 00:06:50.490
Even Amelda and Valon!

00:06:50.490 --> 00:06:54.420
Your friends lost their souls!

00:06:54.420 --> 00:06:57.090
And you still feel nothing?

00:06:57.090 --> 00:06:59.290
I told you before.

00:06:59.290 --> 00:07:05.540
In this world, there's a destiny that humans can do nothing about.

00:07:05.540 --> 00:07:11.540
To know where destiny leads, you must accept it.

00:07:11.540 --> 00:07:14.970
I want to know where destiny leads.

00:07:15.480 --> 00:07:20.490
And I’m willing to offer my life and soul to know!

00:07:20.490 --> 00:07:27.840
Why does a skilled duelist like you have to obey Dartz’s destiny?

00:07:27.840 --> 00:07:31.950
That's not why we have souls!

00:07:32.360 --> 00:07:34.430
Destiny is already in action.

00:07:34.430 --> 00:07:37.930
It's in the next phase.

00:07:37.930 --> 00:07:40.910
Nobody can stop it now.

00:07:44.930 --> 00:07:47.680
What’s that?

00:08:20.280 --> 00:08:23.450
The stars are vanishing.

00:08:28.520 --> 00:08:30.700
Keep it up, Honda!

00:08:36.170 --> 00:08:37.850
Honda!  Anzu!

00:08:38.600 --> 00:08:40.300
Mokuba!

00:08:42.170 --> 00:08:43.340
Kaiba!

00:08:44.120 --> 00:08:47.260
So that loser lost.

00:08:48.060 --> 00:08:49.610
Jonouchi...

00:08:49.610 --> 00:08:51.210
Where's Yugi?

00:08:51.210 --> 00:08:53.780
He went to Paradius alone.

00:08:56.210 --> 00:08:58.090
Mokuba!  What's wrong?

00:08:58.090 --> 00:08:59.890
Th-That!

00:09:05.650 --> 00:09:07.100
Rats!

00:09:09.360 --> 00:09:10.360
This way!

00:09:11.070 --> 00:09:12.820
Go up!

00:09:22.080 --> 00:09:24.770
What’s going on?

00:09:40.480 --> 00:09:45.680
Dartz will soon open the door of destiny.

00:09:45.680 --> 00:09:48.720
And I'll learn where it leads.

00:09:48.720 --> 00:09:52.640
That's why I'll fight you again, Pharaoh!

00:09:54.340 --> 00:09:58.440
I've defeated you before.

00:09:58.440 --> 00:10:03.480
If you lose in The Seal of Orichalcos, you lose your soul.

00:10:03.480 --> 00:10:06.280
But you didn’t lose your soul.

00:10:14.460 --> 00:10:18.380
I don't know why destiny let that happen.

00:10:18.380 --> 00:10:24.120
But when Dartz's destiny is complete, that'll be unimportant.

00:10:24.120 --> 00:10:27.070
You can't defeat me.

00:10:27.070 --> 00:10:31.140
And I'll now prove that's your destiny!

00:10:31.860 --> 00:10:36.670
Rafael!  Why do you let destiny bind you?

00:10:36.670 --> 00:10:40.720
I hoped to duel you again too!

00:10:40.720 --> 00:10:46.100
Because you're a true duelist, not because it’s our destiny!

00:10:46.100 --> 00:10:50.850
Wrong.  Our duel is to fulfill destiny.

00:10:50.850 --> 00:10:54.530
To make that happen, I must take your soul!

00:10:57.200 --> 00:10:59.390
The Seal of Orichalcos!

00:11:00.320 --> 00:11:03.290
Your destiny is here.

00:11:03.290 --> 00:11:06.710
Choose your destiny with your own hands.

00:11:09.150 --> 00:11:14.100
Even if I get The Seal card, I'll never play it again.

00:11:14.580 --> 00:11:16.020
I know.

00:11:16.440 --> 00:11:21.360
Is he going to play The Seal of Orichalcos this time?

00:11:41.470 --> 00:11:42.570
Duel!

00:12:09.280 --> 00:12:11.720
I'll go first.

00:12:11.720 --> 00:12:13.710
My turn!  I draw!

00:12:14.490 --> 00:12:16.720
Watch, Nameless Pharaoh.

00:12:16.720 --> 00:12:18.880
I'll fight my fight to the end.

00:12:19.680 --> 00:12:22.940
The Continuous Spell, Guardian Treasure!

00:12:25.490 --> 00:12:27.630
Guardian Treasure.

00:12:27.630 --> 00:12:32.200
By discarding five cards, he can draw two cards from his deck.

00:12:32.200 --> 00:12:35.700
And starting next turn, he can draw two cards per turn.

00:12:35.700 --> 00:12:38.420
That card strengthened his draw.

00:12:39.930 --> 00:12:43.910
I summon Backup Gardna in defense position!

00:12:44.440 --> 00:12:47.580
I set a card and end my turn.

00:12:47.580 --> 00:12:50.240
My turn!  I draw!

00:12:50.240 --> 00:12:54.080
I summon Queen's Knight in defense position!

00:12:55.050 --> 00:12:56.600
I end my turn.

00:12:57.200 --> 00:13:03.550
If he’s going to use The Seal of Orichalcos, when will he play it?

00:13:03.550 --> 00:13:05.690
My turn!  I draw!

00:13:06.660 --> 00:13:11.700
Nameless Pharaoh, my friends are happy to see you again.

00:13:11.700 --> 00:13:15.060
One wants to say hello.

00:13:15.060 --> 00:13:17.640
The Equip Spell, Gravity Axe - Grarl!

00:13:20.980 --> 00:13:26.160
Gravity Axe's effect Special Summons Guardian Grarl!

00:13:26.960 --> 00:13:33.090
Due to Backup Gardna's effect, I transfer Gravity Axe to Guardian Grarl!

00:13:35.790 --> 00:13:38.460
Go, Guardian Grarl!

00:13:38.460 --> 00:13:40.280
Decisive Slash!

00:13:46.360 --> 00:13:47.920
I end my turn.

00:13:47.920 --> 00:13:50.070
My turn!  I draw!

00:13:50.070 --> 00:13:56.340
I use the spell card Monster Reborn to revive Queen's Knight in attack position!

00:13:57.610 --> 00:14:02.450
I summon King's Knight from my hand in attack position!

00:14:02.450 --> 00:14:05.320
I activate King's Knight’s effect!

00:14:05.320 --> 00:14:09.250
When King's Knight and Queen's Knight are both on my field...

00:14:09.250 --> 00:14:13.860
... I can Special Summon Jack's Knight from my deck!

00:14:14.780 --> 00:14:18.430
Then I activate the spell card, Brave Attack!

00:14:18.740 --> 00:14:20.100
That card is…

00:14:20.100 --> 00:14:23.900
I activate a spell card from my hand!

00:14:23.900 --> 00:14:25.510
Brave Attack!

00:14:25.510 --> 00:14:28.140
Go, Magnet Warriors!

00:14:31.150 --> 00:14:32.180
What?

00:14:41.990 --> 00:14:46.160
It's the spell card that destroyed a god - Dark Obelisk!

00:14:46.160 --> 00:14:54.800
Yes.  Brave Attack lets me combine my monsters' attack points to fight one of your monsters.

00:14:54.800 --> 00:14:56.600
In exchange for their lives!

00:14:56.600 --> 00:15:02.280
Did you forget that you hurt yourself by sacrificing your monsters?

00:15:02.280 --> 00:15:08.210
Rafael, I won't let your words confuse me anymore!

00:15:09.390 --> 00:15:12.790
I believe in the bond with my monsters!

00:15:12.790 --> 00:15:15.390
We share pain and joy together!

00:15:15.390 --> 00:15:17.840
Go, my Knights!

00:15:18.600 --> 00:15:20.760
Show him the power of unity!

00:15:25.600 --> 00:15:27.240
I flip over my set card!

00:15:27.950 --> 00:15:29.670
Guardian Force!

00:15:29.670 --> 00:15:34.160
I can activate it when there are no Guardians in my graveyard.

00:15:34.160 --> 00:15:38.680
It negates and destroys a spell card.

00:15:45.020 --> 00:15:48.790
Your unity is weak, so I can easily break it.

00:15:49.440 --> 00:15:50.960
I end my turn.

00:15:50.960 --> 00:15:54.410
His strategy has no weaknesses.

00:15:54.410 --> 00:15:57.900
And if he plays The Seal of Orichalcos...

00:15:58.230 --> 00:16:00.340
My turn!  I draw!

00:16:00.340 --> 00:16:06.030
But I can’t imagine him using The Seal.

00:16:06.030 --> 00:16:09.780
I can’t even believe he used it against Mai.

00:16:10.170 --> 00:16:12.780
The Equip Spell, Butterfly Dagger - Elma!

00:16:15.150 --> 00:16:20.000
The equipped monster gains 300 attack points!

00:16:21.100 --> 00:16:25.760
Butterfly Dagger lets me summon Guardian Elma!

00:16:27.000 --> 00:16:29.360
A new Guardian monster.

00:16:29.830 --> 00:16:32.990
Guardian Elma’s effect activates.

00:16:32.990 --> 00:16:36.800
It equips an Equip Spell in my graveyard.

00:16:37.140 --> 00:16:39.410
Equip Guardian Shield!

00:16:41.480 --> 00:16:48.180
Backup Gardna’s effect transfers Butterfly Dagger to Guardian Elma.

00:16:49.450 --> 00:16:53.600
Guardian Elma, attack Queen's Knight!

00:16:55.290 --> 00:16:56.860
Fervent Thunder!

00:16:59.310 --> 00:17:03.460
Then Guardian Grarl attacks King's Knight!

00:17:03.460 --> 00:17:05.170
Decisive Slash!

00:17:12.870 --> 00:17:14.730
I end my turn.

00:17:16.560 --> 00:17:17.990
He’s tough.

00:17:17.990 --> 00:17:21.730
Even without The Seal.

00:17:21.730 --> 00:17:24.230
My turn!  I draw!

00:17:24.820 --> 00:17:27.650
I have a Level 5 monster.

00:17:27.910 --> 00:17:32.090
I activate Five Star Twilight from my hand!

00:17:32.090 --> 00:17:37.400
Jack's Knight’s five stars calls a new monster!

00:17:37.400 --> 00:17:39.980
Come, the five Kuriboh brothers!

00:17:41.350 --> 00:17:43.500
Those pipsqueaks are here.

00:17:43.500 --> 00:17:49.510
I discard a trap card from my hand to activate Kuriboo’s effect!

00:17:49.510 --> 00:17:52.040
Come out, Kuriball!

00:18:03.440 --> 00:18:05.630
Grarl’s attack points are...

00:18:05.630 --> 00:18:08.300
It's Kuriball's effect!

00:18:08.690 --> 00:18:14.730
It lowers your monster's attack points by 1500 for this turn.

00:18:14.730 --> 00:18:21.820
And Kuribah’s effect merges the five Kuriboh brothers together into Kuribabylon!

00:18:22.950 --> 00:18:24.350
That’s not enough.

00:18:24.350 --> 00:18:27.910
Guardian Grarl also has 1500 attack points!

00:18:27.910 --> 00:18:30.770
I’m still preparing for the fight!

00:18:30.770 --> 00:18:34.150
I activate my spell Mystical Space Typhoon from my hand!

00:18:34.150 --> 00:18:34.930
What?

00:18:34.930 --> 00:18:40.930
This card destroys a spell or trap on the field!

00:18:40.930 --> 00:18:42.860
I destroy Gravity Axe!

00:18:46.300 --> 00:18:49.020
Go, Kuribabylon!

00:18:49.020 --> 00:18:51.400
Attack Guardian Grarl!

00:18:52.840 --> 00:18:53.980
Elma!

00:19:00.640 --> 00:19:01.550
What?

00:19:01.850 --> 00:19:05.030
Guardian Shield’s effect activates!

00:19:05.030 --> 00:19:10.220
By destroying the Shield, my monster isn't destroyed in battle.

00:19:10.880 --> 00:19:15.900
But I still take battle damage.

00:19:15.900 --> 00:19:20.070
He sacrificed his life points to protect his monster.

00:19:20.070 --> 00:19:23.390
I set a card and end my turn!

00:19:24.090 --> 00:19:27.170
Oh yeah.  That’s how you fight.

00:19:27.170 --> 00:19:30.610
You won't let your monsters go to the graveyard.

00:19:30.610 --> 00:19:35.130
You have a bond.  You and your monsters protect each other.

00:19:35.130 --> 00:19:39.120
You're not the type of duelist who'd use The Seal of Orichalcos!

00:19:41.060 --> 00:19:47.060
Your dueling ideals and The Seal of Orichalcos are incompatible!

00:19:47.540 --> 00:19:50.060
To protect the bond with your monsters...

00:19:50.060 --> 00:19:53.900
...you won't let the darkness in your heart overcome you!

00:19:53.900 --> 00:19:55.740
Isn't that right, Rafael?

00:19:55.740 --> 00:19:58.740
My turn.  I draw.

00:19:58.740 --> 00:20:02.180
Pharaoh, you're right.

00:20:02.720 --> 00:20:03.660
But…

00:20:05.520 --> 00:20:10.620
But that's not enough to know where destiny leads.

00:20:10.620 --> 00:20:16.070
When I can accept and assimilate with the darkness and let go of everything…

00:20:16.070 --> 00:20:18.970
…light will finally reach the darkness.

00:20:20.500 --> 00:20:24.440
Beyond that lies great destiny.

00:20:24.810 --> 00:20:26.370
Rafael...

00:20:26.370 --> 00:20:32.320
We're alike, but we've taken different paths.

00:20:32.320 --> 00:20:36.500
That's why you couldn't fully utilize it.

00:20:36.500 --> 00:20:40.980
I'll show you the true power of this card!

00:20:40.980 --> 00:20:42.920
Don’t do it, Rafael!

00:20:45.740 --> 00:20:49.520
I activate The Seal of Orichalcos!

00:20:52.350 --> 00:20:54.520
Yugi!

00:20:55.260 --> 00:20:56.480
That’s…

00:20:57.120 --> 00:20:58.410
Mai!

00:21:02.090 --> 00:21:04.060
What’s going on?

00:21:04.060 --> 00:21:05.270
Mai too?

00:21:05.720 --> 00:21:07.210
They’re on the roof.

00:21:12.220 --> 00:21:13.510
Rafael!

00:21:24.420 --> 00:21:25.690
Yugi!

00:21:25.690 --> 00:21:26.860
Yugi...

00:21:58.700 --> 00:22:07.580
The streets flow by, colored in red

00:22:08.110 --> 00:22:15.950
If you notice your pain, it changes to joy

00:22:17.680 --> 00:22:27.110
People learn of friendship every time they wipe their tears

00:22:27.720 --> 00:22:36.600
With the warm strength you gave me, I'll change them into kindness

00:22:37.200 --> 00:22:45.660
My overflowing emotions don't stop

00:22:46.440 --> 00:22:51.170
I'll live feeling them

00:22:51.780 --> 00:22:56.320
For me to be me

00:22:56.320 --> 00:23:04.810
Overflowing friendship heals me

00:23:05.490 --> 00:23:10.450
Our chance meeting was real

00:23:10.970 --> 00:23:20.110
We'll both understand that someday

00:23:26.340 --> 00:23:32.410
Waiting for Yugi at Paradius was Rafael - the guy who defeated Yugi before.

00:23:32.410 --> 00:23:37.290
Though he's the enemy, Yugi identifies with his respect for his monsters.

00:23:37.290 --> 00:23:42.410
He's surprised that Rafael activated The Seal of Orichalcos.

00:23:42.960 --> 00:23:47.260
He summons the Guardian Eatos that defeated Yugi.  And...

00:23:47.260 --> 00:23:50.490
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Immortal!
Guardian Dreadscythe

00:23:50.490 --> 00:23:52.180
Duel, standby!
